login":"kop0311","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDQ4MzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/commits/98de35275b32f6c95dcddaeea2a09c1bd336b630/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-23T06:39:15Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-23T06:39:15Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"message":"feat: Add comprehensive debugging and database setup endpoints\n\n🔍 新增诊断工具:\n\n## 调试端点\n- /api/debug - 全面的系统诊断\n  * 环境变量检查\n  * 依赖模块验证\n  * 数据库连接测试\n  * 表结构验证\n  * 自动问题诊断和修复建议\n\n## 数据库设置端点\n- /api/setup-db - 自动数据库初始化\n  * 创建users表和索引\n  * 设置触发器\n  * 创建默认管理员用户\n  * 验证表结构\n\n## 诊断功能\n- 检查所有环境变量状态\n- 验证bcryptjs和jsonwebtoken依赖\n- 测试PostgreSQL连接\n- 检查users表是否存在\n- 统计用户数量\n- 提供具体的修复步骤\n\n## 使用方式\n1. 访问 /api/debug 查看系统状态\n2. 如果发现问题，按照建议修复\n3. 使用 POST /api/setup-db 初始化数据库\n4. 重新测试注册功能\n\n🎯 目标: 快速诊断和修复500错误\n📊 影响: 提供详细的错误信息和自动修复能力","tree":{"sha":"dccd60233ffd3a15f1e6fd5e585adf08f96fd819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/git/trees/dccd60233ffd3a15f1e6fd5e585adf08f96fd819"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/git/commits/98de35275b32f6c95dcddaeea2a09c1bd336b630","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70048310?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use