ithub.com/users/kop0311/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/commits/2c3019d8582f2183fef6f9810217cb570bde3958/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-23T06:30:02Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-23T06:30:02Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"message":"fix: Fix vercel.json configuration errors and add validation\n\n🔧 Vercel配置修复:\n\n## 修复的问题\n- 移除已弃用的 ''name'' 属性 (Vercel CLI警告)\n- 移除不支持的 ''description'' 属性 (Vercel CLI错误)\n- 保持所有功能配置完整\n\n## 新增验证工具\n- scripts/validate-vercel-config.js - Vercel配置验证脚本\n- 自动检测已弃用属性\n- 验证JSON格式和配置有效性\n- 提供修复建议和有效配置示例\n\n## 增强部署脚本\n- 在部署前验证vercel.json配置\n- 添加JSON语法检查\n- 更好的错误处理和提示\n\n## 当前有效配置\n- ✅ version: 2\n- ✅ 环境变量配置\n- ✅ 区域设置 (iad1)\n- ✅ API函数超时配置\n- ✅ 安全头配置\n- ✅ GitHub集成配置\n\n🎯 解决: Vercel CLI部署时的配置错误\n📦 影响: 确保部署脚本正常运行","tree":{"sha":"d3e219240a66e520b5b29c647da44b375a74df2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/git/trees/d3e219240a66e520b5b29c647da44b375a74df2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/git/commits/2c3019d8582f2183fef6f9810217cb570bde3958","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70048310?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kop0311","id":70048310,"login":"kop0311","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDQ4MzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kop0311/KD_family/commit/2c3019d8582f2183fef6f9810217cb570bde3958","node_id":"C_kwDOPPyW5doAKDJjMzAxOWQ4NTgyZjIxODNmZWY2Zjk4MTAyMTdjYjU3MGJkZTM5NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kop0311/KD_family/commit/3d5047e2b9a8963097043455ff7af751e4a494a9","sha":"3d5047e2b9a8963097043455ff7af751e4a494a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/commits/3d5047e2b9a8963097043455ff7af751e4a494a9"}],"sha":"2c3019d8582f2183fef6f9810217cb570bde3958","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/commits/2c3019d8582f2183fef6f9810217cb570bde3958"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70048310?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kop0311","id":70048310,"login":"kop0311","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDQ4MzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/commits/3d5047e2b9a8963097043455ff7af751e4a494a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-23T06:11:47Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-23T06:11:47Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"message":"feat: Add automated Vercel deployment and configuration scripts\n\n🚀 Vercel自动化部署工具:\n\n## 新增自动化脚本\n- scripts/deploy-to-vercel.sh - 一键部署脚本（推荐）\n- scripts/setup-vercel-config.js - Node.js配置脚本\n- scripts/setup-vercel-env.sh - 环境变量配置脚本\n\n## 功能特性\n- 自动检查和安装依赖（Vercel CLI）\n- 自动配置环境变量（JWT_SECRET, DATABASE_URL）\n- 自动构建和部署项目\n- 部署验证和状态检查\n- 支持Supabase数据库自动配置\n\n## 增强的vercel.json配置\n- 添加安全头配置（X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options）\n- API函数超时设置（30秒）\n- 缓存控制策略\n- 自动重定向配置\n\n## 使用方式\n1. 一键部署: ./scripts/deploy-to-vercel.sh\n2. 仅配置环境变量: node scripts/setup-vercel-config.js\n3. Bash环境配置: ./scripts/setup-vercel-env.sh\n\n## 预设配置\n- JWT_SECRET: 已预设安全密钥\n- Supabase项目: pjnqbsnmrfhkyhoqfekv\n- 数据库区域: us-east-1\n- 自动生成DATABASE_URL\n\n🎯 目标: 简化Vercel部署流程，一键完成所有配置\n📦 影响: 大幅降低部署复杂度，提高开发效率","tree":{"sha":"f236da0b15d349a1066e9086aca0cac19cd065e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/git/trees/f236da0b15d349a1066e9086aca0cac19cd065e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/git/commits/3d5047e2b9a8963097043455ff7af751e4a494a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70048310?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kop0311","id":70048310,"login":"kop0311","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDQ4MzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/received_events"