-23T05:51:47Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-23T05:51:47Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"message":"fix: Add comprehensive error handling and debugging for registration API\n\n🔧 Registration API Debugging:\n\n## Enhanced Error Handling\n- Added detailed logging throughout registration process\n- Dynamic imports to handle potential module loading issues\n- Comprehensive environment variable validation\n- Step-by-step error reporting for better debugging\n\n## New Debug Endpoint\n- Created /api/test-db for database connection testing\n- Environment variable validation\n- Database connectivity verification\n\n## Improved Registration Endpoint\n- Better error messages with specific failure points\n- Detailed console logging for Vercel function debugging\n- Graceful handling of import failures\n- Database operation error isolation\n\n## Debugging Features\n- Request body parsing validation\n- Password hashing error handling\n- Database query error isolation\n- JWT generation error handling\n\n🎯 Purpose: Diagnose and fix 500 Internal Server Error in registration\n📊 Impact: Better error reporting for production debugging","tree":{"sha":"b5588b382de6ade3f4307909ccb18ec41d19a7c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/git/trees/b5588b382de6ade3f4307909ccb18ec41d19a7c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/git/commits/e0ca9210736c0286aaa1378cf8e98e676c6b260c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70048310?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kop031