thub.com/users/kop0311","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/commits/a827f9fcb87a25c1a801f6797b54f17bb3640dae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-23T05:37:08Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-23T05:37:08Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"message":"feat: Implement complete user registration system\n\n🔐 Major Authentication Enhancement:\n\n## New Features\n- Complete user registration functionality with form validation\n- Combined login/registration interface with tabbed design\n- Secure password hashing with bcrypt (12 rounds)\n- JWT-based authentication with 7-day expiration\n- Role-based user creation (advisor/parent/member)\n\n## Backend Implementation\n- Created auth API endpoints:\n  * POST /api/auth/register - User registration with validation\n  * POST /api/auth/login - User authentication\n  * POST /api/auth/logout - Session cleanup\n  * GET /api/auth/me - Current user information\n- Comprehensive input validation and security measures\n- SQL injection protection with parameterized queries\n- Email/username uniqueness validation\n\n## Frontend Implementation\n- New AuthForm component with login/registration tabs\n- Real-time form validation and error handling\n- Password visibility toggles for better UX\n- Role selection dropdown for user registration\n- Updated AuthProvider with registration support\n- Created useAuth hook for authentication state management\n\n## UI Components Added\n- Tabs component for login/registration switching\n- Alert component for error/success messages\n- Label component for form accessibility\n- Enhanced form validation and user feedback\n\n## Database Schema\n- Comprehensive users table with all necessary fields\n- Proper indexing for performance optimization\n- Role-based access control structure\n- Audit fields (created_at, updated_at, last_login)\n\n## Security Features\n- bcrypt password hashing with 12 salt rounds\n- JWT token authentication with expiration\n- Input sanitization and validation\n- Protection against common vulnerabilities\n\n## Dependencies Added\n- bcryptjs & @types/bcryptjs - Password hashing\n- jsonwebtoken & @types/jsonwebtoken - JWT authentication\n- @radix-ui/react-tabs & @radix-ui/react-label - UI components\n- class-variance-authority - Component styling\n\n## Type System Updates\n- Added fullName field to User interface\n- Updated API response types for registration\n- Enhanced type safety across auth flow\n\n✅ Build Status: All tests passing, production build successful\n🎯 Resolves: Critical business logic gap where new users couldn''t create accounts\n📦 Bundle Impact: Login page optimized (263kB with registration functionality)\n�� Security: Industry-standard authentication practices implemented\n\nReady for production deployment with complete user registration capabilities.","tree":{"sha":"e35b985af45331dea602d58b7c48b5e4b4cb9e74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/git/trees/e35b985af45331dea602d58b7c48b5e4b4cb9e74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/git/commits/a827f9fcb87a25c1a801f6797b54f17bb3640dae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70048310?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kop0311","id":70048310,"login":"kop0311","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDQ4MzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/repos","site_admin":