.github.com/users/kop0311/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kop0311","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kop0311/KD_family/commits/f305b1614d96f6ebeeceaf89f45baea638e80392/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-23T03:44:09Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-23T03:44:09Z","email":"koplee@gmail.com","name":"koplee"},"message":"feat: Optimize KD Family project for Vercel deployment\n\n🚀 Major deployment preparation and optimization:\n\n## Build & TypeScript Fixes\n- Fixed all TypeScript compilation errors and type mismatches\n- Resolved import path issues and removed duplicate module structure\n- Updated API method signatures and added missing endpoints\n- Fixed async thunk parameter ordering in Redux slices\n- Aligned Task interfaces across the codebase\n\n## Vercel Configuration\n- Added vercel.json with proper serverless function configuration\n- Updated next.config.js for Vercel compatibility\n- Created lib/database.ts for PostgreSQL connection pooling\n- Optimized for serverless environment deployment\n\n## Project Structure Cleanup\n- Consolidated modular structure from modules/ to root level\n- Removed duplicate files and outdated module directories\n- Cleaned up component imports and dependencies\n- Updated .gitignore for Next.js and Vercel best practices\n\n## Deployment Tools\n- Added scripts/prepare-deployment.js for pre-deployment validation\n- Created DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md with step-by-step guide\n- Updated .env.example with Vercel-compatible variables\n- Added npm script for deployment preparation\n\n## Database Integration\n- Configured for external PostgreSQL (Neon, Supabase compatible)\n- Added con