Replaced all ''any'' types with proper typed interfaces\n- Updated imports to include new privacy types\n- Added DataCategoryExport to imports for proper data export handling\n- Fixed processDataAccessRequest to use DataCategoryExport conversion\n- TypeScript compilation passes without errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: Update PRD VIBE-001 to passes true and add progress log\n\n* feat: SEC-001 - Phase 1 CRITICAL Security Fixes\n\n- Add missing _generateNonce() method to SecurityHeadersMiddleware\n- Fix hardcoded secrets in .env (replaced with secure placeholders)\n- Enable CSRF protection (ENABLE_CSRF=true)\n- Disable Swagger in production by default\n- Add security documentation comments\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: CODE-001a/b - Remove ''any'' types from analytics DTO and LLM services\n\n- Create proper interfaces for analytics data structures:\n  - UserSessionData, DeviceInfoData, GeoLocationData\n  - EventPayload, EventContextData, EventTimestampData, EventDataStructure\n- Replace ''any'' types in AnalyticsEventData with typed interfaces\n- Update factory methods to use proper types (EventPayload, EventContextData)\n- Remove eslint-disable comments for ''no-explicit-any''\n- Create RawResumeData, RawWorkExperience, RawEducation interfaces\n- Create RawJdData interface for JD extraction\n- Fix createGeminiClient to avoid ''any'' type usage\n- All restore methods now use proper typed interfaces\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: VIBE-001 - Refactor privacy-compliance.service into modular services\n\nBreak up 1,310-line privacy-compliance.service.ts into focused modules\nfollowing Service Layering Pattern:\n\nCreated services directory structure:\n- consent-management.service.ts (~370 lines) - Core consent operations\n- consent-cascade.service.ts (~326 lines) - Consent withdrawal propagation\n- data-subject-rights.service.ts (~167 lines) - GDPR rights requests\n- data-collection.service.ts (~307 lines) - Data gathering from services\n- data-export.service.ts (~308 lines) - Secure export generation\n- data-erasure.service.ts (~218 lines) - Data deletion operations\n- privacy-compliance.service.ts (~233 lines) - Refactored to facade\n\nAll files under 500 lines per project standards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: Update PRD CODE-001c to passes true and log progress\n\n- Mark CODE-001c as complete\n- Add progress log with learnings about service layering and enum conflicts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: Reset PRD for Phase 3 comprehensive cleanup\n\n- Reset progress.txt with codebase patterns\n- Created CODE-002 with 6 subtasks for all remaining issues:\n  * CODE-002a: Fix failing LLM tests\n  * CODE-002b: Remove remaining ''any'' types from services\n  * CODE-002c: Split large Angular components\n  * CODE-002d: Split large DTO files\n  * CODE-002e: Fix lint warnings in report-generator\n  * CODE-002f: Fix lint warning in jd-extractor\n- New branch: refactor/code-cleanup\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: Split CODE-002 into 39 granular subtasks\n\n- 39 focused subtasks for independent AI development\n- Each subtask has clear acceptance criteria\n- Total estimated effort: ~50 hours\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: CODE-002b-1 - Remove ''any'' types from analytics.dto.ts\n\nReplace ''any'' type with ''unknown'' for event data properties:\n- eventData: any -> unknown\n- context?: any -> unknown\n- eventTypeStatistics: Record<string, any> -> Record<string, unknown>\n- retentionPolicies: any[] -> unknown[]\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: Update PRD CODE-002b-1 to passes: true and log progress\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: CODE-002b-2 - Remove ''any'' types from user-management.service.ts\n