\n* feat: CODE-002d-4 - Split analytics.service.ts into modular components\n\nSplit 1114-line analytics.service.ts into focused modules:\n\n- analytics-event-collection.service.ts (245 lines) - Event creation methods\n  - createUserInteractionEvent\n  - createSystemPerformanceEvent\n  - createBusinessMetricEvent\n\n- analytics-aggregation.service.ts (279 lines) - Batch processing and metrics\n  - processBatchEvents\n  - getEventProcessingMetrics\n  - getDataPrivacyMetrics\n\n- analytics-reporting.service.ts (306 lines) - Reporting and compliance\n  - performPrivacyComplianceCheck\n  - generateDataRetentionReport\n  - getSessionAnalytics\n  - validateReportingAccess\n\n- analytics-result-classes.ts (294 lines) - All result classes\n  - EventCreationResult, BatchProcessingResult, PrivacyComplianceResult\n  - DataRetentionReportResult, SessionAnalyticsResult\n  - EventProcessingMetricsResult, DataPrivacyMetricsResult, ReportingAccessResult\n\n- analytics-interfaces.ts (158 lines) - Interface definitions\n  - IAnalyticsRepository, IDomainEventBus, IAuditLogger\n  - IPrivacyService, ISessionTracker\n\n- analytics.service.ts (146 lines) - Re-exports and facade class for backward compatibility\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: CODE-002d-5 - Split usage-limit.dto.ts into modular components\n\nSplit 913-line usage-limit.dto.ts into focused modules:\n\n- usage-limit-types.dto.ts (322 lines) - Value objects and types\n  - UsageLimitId, IPAddress, UsageLimitPolicy\n  - QuotaAllocation, UsageTracking, UsageRecord\n  - BonusType enum, UsageLimitData interface\n\n- usage-limit-core.dto.ts (306 lines) - Main UsageLimit entity\n  - create() - factory method for new instances\n  - restore() - factory method for data restoration\n  - canUse() - checks if usage is allowed\n  - recordUsage() - records usage with validation\n  - addBonusQuota() - adds bonus quota\n  - getUsageStatistics() - returns usage stats\n\n- usage-limit-events.dto.ts (110 lines)