s\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: CODE-003-11 - Extract questionnaire validation logic\n\n- Created questionnaire-validation.dto.ts with QuestionnaireValidationResult, validation constants, and utility functions\n- Created questionnaire-value-objects.dto.ts with UserProfile, UserExperience, BusinessValue, FeatureNeeds, OptionalInfo, SubmissionMetadata, QualityScore, SubmissionSummary, Answer, QualityMetrics\n- Updated questionnaire.dto.ts to import and re-export from new files\n- Updated questionnaire.rules.ts to import QuestionnaireValidationResult from new validation file\n- Reduced questionnaire.dto.ts from 1094 to 765 lines (target: <800)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: Update progress - mark CODE-003-11 complete\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: CODE-003-12 - Extract questionnaire response DTOs\n\n- Created questionnaire-responses.dto.ts re-exporting QuestionnaireResponseDto and QuestionnaireAnalyticsDto\n- Created questionnaire-submission.dto.ts with QuestionnaireTemplate, QuestionnaireSubmission, and SubmissionQuality classes\n- Extracted submission-related classes to avoid circular dependencies\n- Reduced questionnaire.dto.ts from 724 to 386 lines (target: <600)\n- All 76 questionnaire tests pass\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: Update progress - mark CODE-003-12 complete\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: CODE-003-13 - Extract questionnaire question definitions\n\n- Created questionnaire-questions.dto.ts re-exporting QuestionSection and QualityThreshold\n- Updated questionnaire.dto.ts to re-export from questionnaire-questions.dto.ts\n- File at 391 lines (target: <500)\n- Quality checks: typecheck passes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: Update progress - mark CODE-003-13 complete\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: Resolve CI-blocking issues - lint errors and test failures\n\n- Fix arrow function in virtual-scroll template binding (use .bind())\n- Add missing CommonModule import to timesheet-cell component\n- Fix incentive.service.spec.ts import paths to correct source files\n- Change export type to export for PaymentProcessingResult (has static methods)\n- Fix index.ts re-exports for IncentiveStatsResult and PendingIncentivesResult\n- Move ValueObject import to top of file in usage-limit-results.dto.ts\n- Add RULE 9 for parallel execution with subagents in CLAUDE.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: Resolve 3 pre-existing test failures blocking pre-push hook\n\n- TimesheetTable: Fix spy on non-existent downloadCSV method - use TimesheetExportUtil.exportData instead\n- ReportTemplatesService: Use useFactory to inject mock GridFsService, avoiding NestJS dependency resolution issues\n- ReportGeneratorService: Use useFactory to inject mock services with proper type casting\n\nAll 148 test suites (3065 tests) now pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: Resolve frontend build errors blocking pre-push hook\n\nMultiple fixes for production build failures:\n\n1. Store import paths - Use correct relative paths for store imports in analytics-data.service.ts\n\n2. DataTableScrollUtil - Remove Angular-specific types to avoid decorator requirement:\n   - Remove ElementRef import, create GenericElementRef interface\n   - Remove implements OnDestroy, rename ngOnDestroy to destroy()\n   - Use GenericElementRef type for scroll detection\n\n3. ErrorReportFormComponent - Add missing onFormSubmit() method to emit formSubmit output\n\n4. PageEvent export - Re-export PageEvent from data-table.component.ts for consumers\n\n5. JobStatus type - Define JobStatus locally in job.model.ts to avoid api-contracts import\n\n6. Component selector fix - Change app-mobile-swipe to arc-mobile-swipe in mobile-results-item\n\n7. changeDetection: undefined - Remove invalid changeDetection property from mobile-performance-details\n\n8. Unused imports - Remove unused Output, EventEmitter from mobile-bottom-nav\n\n9. SCSS syntax fix - Fix media query syntax in mobile-upload-zone.component.ts\n\n10. Create missing _variables.scss - Add SCSS variables file that component stylesheets depend on\n\n11. Update tsconfig.app.json - Add path mappings and exclude test-helper.ts from production build\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(security): Resolve CodeQL security alerts\n\n- Add email length validation to prevent ReDoS (HIGH)\n- Add explicit type for IntersectionObserver options\n- Refactor markStepAsActive to fix useless variable/conditional warnings\n- Use explicit undefined check for dimensions parameter\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jackela <jackela@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpkVuECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHY0QAIMI/RKQv+e3E+HTJnhQJtpc\namcJNByt1GRxj2tlqvXAwIJwuLz62yarEajYDc//csoFMsd9x4uTvRAQ03qjzyvG\naBXuAX+fl+MP8tgtyaqwIfv5V1phWGQSF3NBKP2pavI/AfXiRQVESe8YfdYhtui8\n8rXk6qyjwegPLVcz4q7/RjSqWm98jVE2hHNc8BG+xP0ExL0GOxTRsxrGmYe6i4Oc\n/5Ly6gUJT1ZfJIjQSarIEvJrYZp3wnSlbnTHiR8cL5gHEbtzjhxez0886S9duYfY\npvWRgM1dlVcedMsQm5rZm9Z/xIauduSTxQoBeWr+zh4/fKkDpMsOpyJ82TXpOM+g\nZPrrnY1yJhdS90PaS1MPBXWOBJfWvymV+2NOARO7hnwWCWIumPDEGoCDez9iExf4\nz3UdDHTi5uwT8DKEsgIrGGtqi1VYtoyT/T42U10rZG011xegQZypZIh8sPm45okA\n6n1s0KoVSHA7jR2pkQXQA7mP7s++3oQo+wOzTgCa3XsSBfjPU5/Ayjdgcx1fYIri\ntwmEvNs7vp9wjPi3JDov6NIbIW+B6XCb4bQD8ZHrzUdJG97Qbq0hHQ19jPkNITQ1\nFvwbv1pBq+gFIsYs8nmj96i05sWmchDEklrIaXNzFkj7dnyok0+zlD8HXQ/dUkc6\nqHbqm2QcsEqwcJxeuSra\n=caKs\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-15T05:37:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"