a/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/93b752c71665fd186151e7a3cba164e224a01846/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T05:57:29Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T05:57:29Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"message":"fix: Validate input at source to prevent XSS and file write issues\n\nImplement proper input validation at the source (POST endpoint) rather than\noutput sanitization. This prevents malicious data from ever being stored.\n\nChanges in flags.controller.ts:\n- Add validateAndSanitizeDescription() - only allows safe characters\n- Add validateCohort() - validates cohort identifiers\n- Add validateUpdatedBy() - validates user identifiers\n- Validate all string fields in upsert() before storing\n- Remove output sanitization (not needed when input is validated)\n\nChanges in dual-run.middleware.ts:\n- Add sanitizeRoute() - validates route paths before logging\n- Add sanitizeErrorMessage() - redacts secrets from error messages\n- Validate scores are numbers and in valid range\n- Validate hashes are proper hex strings\n- Final JSON validation before file write\n\nThis approach addresses CodeQL''s taint analysis by ensuring data is\nvalidated before it can flow to any \"sink\" operations.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9e4d6f15865d749f4189c79fd2d08910de3b378","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/trees/a9e4d6f15865d749f4189c79fd2d08910de3b378"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/commits/93b752c71665fd186151e7a3cba164e224a01846","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27112787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/93b752c71665fd186151e7a3cba164e224a01846","node_id":"C_kwDOPQgpntoAKDkzYjc1MmM3MTY2NWZkMTg2MTUxZTdhM2NiYTE2NGUyMjRhMDE4NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/6cf00f94aea9307c0c9a616a61faac9e4913b07f","sha":"6cf00f94aea9307c0c9a616a61faac9e4913b07f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/6cf00f94aea9307c0c9a616a61faac9e4913b07f"}],"sha":"93b752c71665fd186151e7a3cba164e224a01846","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/93b752c71665fd186151e7a3cba164e224a01846"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27112787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/6cf00f94aea9307c0c9a616a61faac9e4913b07f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T05:16:56Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T05:16:56Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"message":"fix: Use proper HTML entity encoding for XSS prevention\n\nReplace flawed regex-based sanitization with OWASP-recommended\nHTML entity encoding to prevent XSS attacks.\n\nChanges:\n- Use character-by-character HTML escaping (& -> &amp;, < -> &lt;, etc.)\n- This prevents HTML injection, script injection, and attribute injection\n- Enhanced error sanitization in dual-run middleware with comprehensive patterns\n\nFixes CodeQL alerts:\n- Incomplete URL scheme check\n- Incomplete multi-character sanitization\n- Polynomial regular expression (ReDoS)\n- Bad HTML filtering regexp\n- Reflected cross-site scripting\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e627bed8918f5c941355fefe4b2c747a1d3c902","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/trees/3e627bed8918f5c941355fefe4b2c747a1d3c902"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/commits/6cf00f94aea9307c0c9a616a61faac9e4913b07f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27112787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/6cf00f94aea9307c0c9a616a61faac9e4913b07f","node_id":"C_kwDOPQgpntoAKDZjZjAwZjk0YWVhOTMwN2MwYzlhNjE2YTYxZmFhYzllNDkxM2IwN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/fc10964fa4f3f909ba4bf77f331ac1c3061924b1","sha":"fc10964fa4f3f909ba4bf77f331ac1c3061924b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/fc10964fa4f3f909ba4bf77f331ac1c3061924b1"}],"sha":"6cf00f94aea9307c0c9a616a61faac9e4913b07f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/6cf00f94aea9307c0c9a616a61faac9e4913b07f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27112787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/fc10964fa4f3f909ba4bf77f331ac1c3061924b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T02:53:07Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T02:53:07Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"message":"fix: Address CodeQL security alerts (XSS and file write)\n\n- Add output sanitization for feature flag string fields to prevent reflected XSS\n  - Sanitize description, cohorts, and updatedBy fields in FlagsController\n  - Remove HTML tags, script tags, javascript: protocols, and event handlers\n- Add error message sanitization before writing to file in dual-run middleware\n  - Redact sensitive data like passwords, tokens, API keys, credentials\n  - Prevent sensitive information leakage to log files\n\nRelated to PR #43 CodeQL alerts:\n- HIGH: Reflected XSS in flags.controller.ts (lines 27, 35)\n- MEDIUM: Network data written to file in dual-run.middleware.ts (line 80)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a7d31595ce497092d395c08eb9d2bbe2e93fa6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/trees/2a7d31595ce497092d395c08eb9d2bbe2e93fa6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/commits/fc10