zU2YTkxOTVmODgwNWFhNzM4MWEzNDdlYWQwZTlmNTBkN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/0b305d15b8496bdb6763308c98e725f7aa3b7b7b","sha":"0b305d15b8496bdb6763308c98e725f7aa3b7b7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/0b305d15b8496bdb6763308c98e725f7aa3b7b7b"}],"sha":"891ca756a9195f8805aa7381a347ead0e9f50d7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/891ca756a9195f8805aa7381a347ead0e9f50d7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27112787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/0b305d15b8496bdb6763308c98e725f7aa3b7b7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-08T15:31:31Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-08T15:31:31Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"message":"feat: Fix CI issues and enable local detection\n\n## Changes\n\n### Phase 1: Fix TypeScript Configuration\n- Remove relaxed strictness settings from tsconfig.ci.json\n- Local typecheck now catches same errors as webpack build\n- This was an anti-pattern where CI config was more permissive than local\n\n### Phase 2: Add Pre-Commit Hook\n- Create .husky/pre-commit for fast lint and typecheck feedback\n- Runs lint-staged on changed files only\n- Runs affected typecheck on changed projects\n- Provides feedback in <30 seconds for most commits\n\n### Phase 3: Create Lint-Staged Config\n- Create .lintstagedrc.json for fast staged file linting\n- Lints TypeScript/JavaScript files with eslint --fix\n- Formats JSON and Markdown files with prettier\n\n### Phase 4: Improve Pre-Push Hook\n- Update .husky/pre-push to use nx affected\n- Only tests changed projects, significantly faster than full ci:local\n- Maintains delete-only push detection\n\n### Phase 5: Add Nx Caching to CI Workflows\n- Add Nx cache to ci.yml for faster subsequent builds\n- Add Nx cache to ci-affected.yml\n- Add Playwright browser caching\n- Install Playwright browsers explicitly in CI\n\n### Phase 6: Fix TypeScript Errors\n- Fix unused imports and variables throughout codebase\n- Add @types/compression and @types/js-yaml for missing type declarations\n- Create global.d.ts for app-gateway-e2e test environment\n- Fix implicit any type errors in database middleware and usage controller\n- Fix Headers index signature issues with proper type casting\n\n## Benefits\n\n- Local `typecheck` catches same errors as webpack build\n- Pre-commit hook provides fast feedback (<30s)\n- Pre-push hook uses affected targets for faster validation\n- CI runs faster with Nx and Playwright caching\n- E2E tests have proper browser installation in CI\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48d0684aa51c01b9e58d30bcbe5805ea2a7f0f6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/trees/48d0684aa51c01b9e58d30bcbe5805ea2a7f0f6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/commits/0b305d15b8496bdb6763308c98e725f7aa3b7b7b","verification":{"paylo