a/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/872925204b1b0f39d8197b4a899add446b1db3c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-08T14:22:34Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-08T14:22:34Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"message":"fix: Remove unused variables and imports to fix webpack build errors\n\nTypeScript strict mode (noUnusedLocals, noUnusedParameters) was causing webpack\nbuild failures for several services. Fixed by:\n\n1. Removed unused _natsService parameter from parsing.service.enhanced.ts\n2. Removed unused detectMimeType method from parsing.service.ts\n3. Removed unused organizationId parameter from resume-encryption.service.ts\n4. Removed unused CircuitBreaker and RetryHandler from vision-llm.service.ts\n5. Removed unused __buildResumeExtractionPrompt and __buildVisionPrompt methods\n6. Removed unused _reportTemplatesService from reports.controller.ts\n7. Removed unused __reportRepository from performance-monitor.service.ts\n\nThese were \"reserved for future use\" code that was never actually called.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6c369ebbfa67fe685fcd64f29199e1cee156adf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/trees/a6c369ebbfa67fe685fcd64f29199e1cee156adf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/commits/872925204b1b0f39d8197b4a899add446b1db3c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27112787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/872925204b1b0f39d8197b4a899add446b1db3c3","node_id":"C_kwDOPQgpntoAKDg3MjkyNTIwNGIxYjBmMzlkODE5N2I0YTg5OWFkZDQ0NmIxZGIzYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/f426015703920b0b858471651677a07b3be87757","sha":"f426015703920b0b858471651677a07b3be87757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/f426015703920b0b858471651677a07b3be87757"}],"sha":"872925204b1b0f39d8197b4a899add446b1db3c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/872925204b1b0f39d8197b4a899add446b1db3c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27112787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/f426015703920b0b858471651677a07b3be87757/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-08T13:46:47Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-08T13:46:47Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"message":"fix: Remove composite project references and rootDir to fix TypeScript build errors\n\nThe composite project reference setup was causing build failures in CI when using\n`nx affected build`. The error was:\n\n  Output file ''dist/libs/resume-dto/index.d.ts'' has not been built from source\n\nChanges:\n1. Removed `composite: true` from resume-dto and shared-dtos tsconfigs\n2. Removed TypeScript project `references` array from shared-dtos\n3. Simplified resume-dto/tsconfig.json to not use the composite pattern\n4. Removed remaining `rootDir: \"./src\"` from resume-dto/tsconfig.lib.json\n\nNx handles dependency order through its project graph, so the composite\nsetting was unnecessary and caused issues with parallel builds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6711918bc4fddd6a41da145e649ff84b2140d5d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/trees/6711918bc4fddd6a41da145e649ff84b2140d5d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/commits/f426015703920b0b858471651677a07b3be87757","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27112787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/f426015703920b0b858471651677a07b3be87757","node_id":"C_kwDOPQgpntoAKGY0MjYwMTU3MDM5MjBiMGI4NTg0NzE2NTE2NzdhMDdiM2JlODc3NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/ad9b116fa8ef4a1ec3186e0457f681e248b53a5d","sha":"ad9b116fa8ef4a1ec3186e0457f681e248b53a5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/ad9b116fa8ef4a1ec3186e0457f681e248b53a5d"}],"sha":"f426015703920b0b858471651677a07b3be87757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/f426015703920b0b858471651677a07b3be87757"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27112787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/ad9b116fa8ef4a1ec3186e0457f681e248b53a5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-08T13:13:39Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-08T13:23:42Z","email":"jackela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jackela"},"message":"fix: Remove explicit rootDir from library tsconfigs to fix TypeScript project reference validation errors\n\nThe explicit \"rootDir\": \"./src\" in library tsconfigs was causing TypeScript validation errors\nwhen using project references. When projects reference each other, TypeScript validates that\nall referenced files are under the rootDir, but files from referenced projects live in their\nown directories, causing the error:\n\n  File ''libs/shared-nats-client/src/...'' is not under ''rootDir'' ''libs/service-base/src''\n\nBy removing the explicit rootDir, TypeScript automatically infers it from the ''include''\npattern, which correctly handles project references.\n\nAlso fixed: Removed invalid ''fetch-all'' input from ci-affected checkout action.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32fa8a07052b2ca00950d199583455aaec0037a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/trees/32fa8a07052b2ca00950d199583455aaec0037a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/git/commits/ad9b116fa8ef4a1ec3186e0457f681e248b53a5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27112787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela","id":27112787,"login":"Jackela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTEyNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackela","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/ad9b116fa8ef4a1ec3186e0457f681e248b53a5d","node_id":"C_kwDOPQgpntoAKGFkOWIxMTZmYThlZjRhMWVjMzE4NmUwNDU3ZjY4MWUyNDhiNTNhNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commit/29a1663ee5179d2b14fc0d3614234a2129df92d4","sha":"29a1663ee5179d2b14fc0d3614234a2129df92d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/29a1663ee5179d2b14fc0d3614234a2129df92d4"}],"sha":"ad9b116fa8ef4a1ec3186e0457f681e248b53a5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jackela/AI-Recruitment-Clerk/commits/ad9b116fa8ef4a1ec3186e0457f681e248b53a5d"},{"autho