https://github.com/renoschubert","id":46114615,"login":"renoschubert","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MTE0NjE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AIO-2030/alaya-network/commits/a0c9f638ee71ea55fc0de18b7ba105df9f06efc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-20T17:09:11Z","email":"your-email@example.com","name":"your-username"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-20T17:09:11Z","email":"your-email@example.com","name":"your-username"},"message":"feat: implement project architecture independence between aio-base-frontend and alaya-chat-nexus-frontend\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Projects are now completely independent with no cross-dependencies\n\n## Major Changes\n\n### Project Independence\n- Created independent AIO Protocol implementation for alaya-chat-nexus-frontend\n- Eliminated cross-dependencies between aio-base-frontend and alaya-chat-nexus-frontend\n- Both projects can now be built, deployed, and maintained independently\n\n### New Files Added\n- src/alaya-chat-nexus-frontend/src/runtime/AIOProtocolExecutor.ts\n- src/alaya-chat-nexus-frontend/src/runtime/AIOProtocolTypes.ts\n- build-aio-base-frontend.sh\n- build-alaya-chat-nexus.sh\n- build-all-projects.sh\n- PROJECT_ARCHITECTURE_INDEPENDENCE.md\n\n### Technical Implementation\n- Simplified MCP executor in alaya-chat-nexus-frontend focused on pixelmug_stdio\n- Independent type definitions and execution logic\n- Maintained full ALAYA network protocol integration\n- Preserved all device communication and pixel art functionality\n\n### Build System\n- Independent build scripts for each project\n- Comprehensive build verification\n- TypeScript compilation and Vite build success for both projects\n- No shared dependencies between projects\n\n### Documentation\n- Updated README.md with architecture independence details\n- Added comprehensive project structure documentation\n- Documented technical implementation and benefits\n\n## Benefits\n- ✅ Complete deployment flexibility\n- ✅ Development team isolation\n- ✅ Independent maintenance and versioning\n- ✅ Future scalability and modularity\n- ✅ Preserved ALAYA network functionality\n\n## Verification\n- Both projects build successfully independently\n- All TypeScript errors resolved\n- ALAYA MCP integration fully functional\n- Device communication features preserved\n\nCloses: Project independence requirements","tree":{"sha":"fe62138bcbf39a53ea69400dd4c609dc1224599e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AIO-2030/alaya-network/git/trees/fe62138bcbf39a53ea69400dd4c609dc1224599e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AIO-2030/alaya-network/git/commits/a0c9f638ee71ea55fc0de18b7ba105df9f06efc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46114615?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/renoschubert","id":46114615,"login":"renoschubert","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MTE0NjE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://ap