ix chat message area scrolling with proper flex layout\n- Ensure input area stays fixed at bottom of screen\n- Add proper height constraints and overflow handling\n- Simplify container structure for better performance\n\nUI Enhancements:\n- Add visual backgrounds to differentiate chat sections\n- Display contact details (devices, online status, principal ID)\n- Maintain responsive design for mobile and desktop\n- Remove bottom navigation from chat page for cleaner UX\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Fix TypeScript type errors for ContactInfo status field\n- Update status handling from ''Completed'' to ''Blocked''/''Deleted''\n- Ensure proper component rendering and layout consistency\n- Convert all comments to English for code standardization\n\nTechnical Details:\n- Use useRef and scrollIntoView for auto-scroll to latest messages\n- Implement proper flex-box layout with flex-shrink-0 and flex-1\n- Add overflow-y-auto for scrollable message container\n- Clean up mock chat data after testing","tree":{"sha":"d5a630c6b79992f38acd2595a65f9a54511d4640","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AIO-2030/alaya-network/git/trees/d5a630c6b79992f38acd2595a65f9a54511d4640"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AIO-2030/alaya-network/git/commits/5c31287e10049f6ad7b5df0d58ab37846e748e4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46114615?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/renoschubert","id":46114615,"login":"renoschubert","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MTE0NjE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.githu