 all page components (Profile, Index, Contracts, MyDevices, Shop, AddDevice)\n  * Remove \"Danger Zone\" section from Profile page\n  * Maintain responsive design for desktop/mobile sidebar\n  * Clean up unused imports and profile deletion functionality\n\n- src/aio-base-backend:\n  * Update to latest version with English summary improvements\n  * Fix version 0.24.0 adapter compatibility\n\n- src/aio-base-frontend:\n  * Update to latest upstream with MCP server HTTPS support\n  * Upgrade online SDK and prompts\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add multiple summary files for various feature implementations\n- Include Chinese to English translation summaries\n- Document clipboard permissions fixes\n- Record contact implementation and sharing logic improvements\n- Document contract logic and QR code sharing updates\n- Record responsive design implementation and TypeScript compilation fixes\n\nThis commit consolidates major frontend architecture improvements,\nbackend compatibility updates, and comprehensive documentation\nof recent development work across all submodules.","tree":{"sha":"b768e27063b05ff3330005b078c6723da4eb1451","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AIO-2030/alaya-network/git/trees/b768e27063b05ff3330005b078c6723da4eb1451"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AIO-2030/alaya-network/git/commits/0187b9e5d863c7f17f72e1c93dadb1b7849abda6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46114615?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renoschubert/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/renoschubert","id":46114615,"login":"renoschubert","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MTE0NjE1","organizations_url":"https: