pi.github.com/users/ccantillo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/frontend-app-corporate/commits/19367a10c9e9b83ed8eacfd8e88d7992f13965eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:59:33Z","email":"carlos.cantillo@edunext.co","name":"carlos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:40:16Z","email":"55790673+ManuelStarDo@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Manuel Domingues"},"message":"feat: add Invitations tab and seat breakdown\n\nManagers had no view of invitations that were sent but not yet accepted.\nThe Invitations tab lists every invitation with its status, lets\nmanagers resend or cancel pending ones, and filters by one status at a\ntime, matching what the API accepts.\n\nThe header keeps Available Seats as before and explains the soft-cap\nrule in a tooltip: pending invitations do not reserve seats, a seat is\ntaken when an invitation is accepted.\n\nInvitation code now lives in one feature folder with a single query key\nfactory and a single status table.\n\nRelated to: fccn/nau-technical#943\nCo-authored-by: Diana Olarte <diana.olarte@edunext.co>","tree":{"sha":"c0ac83bd02044785e237d6e8ab698728bc978f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/frontend-app-corporate/git/trees/c0ac83bd02044785e237d6e8ab698728bc978f05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/frontend-app-corporate/git/commits/19367a10c9e9b83ed8eacfd8e88d7992f13965eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55790673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ManuelStarDo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ManuelStarDo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ManuelStarDo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ManuelStarDo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ManuelStarDo","id":55790673,"login":"M